{"version":1,"content":"<p>【18：13更新】今日（20日）下午3時許，警方接報指，新清水灣道近聖言中學落斜往黃大仙方向發生交通意外，一輛載有學生的旅遊巴懷疑收掣不及，撞向前面一輛停泊在上址的九巴，初步涉及8人受傷。</p><p>消防派出5輛救護車到場處理。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.158490+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:15:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:52:37.775404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"a4982642c1de1a0d339215255a61525b59e285957127ea1b06a9150d442f7c0b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}